{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "9b92b97b-1d6d-8a82-9a86-a0710a35fdeb",
  "created_at": "2026-02-04T14:20:20-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, City Clerk",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Nora Sullivan",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Rosa Delgado",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-04T14:17:00-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "City Clerk's office, this is Rosa. How can I help you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-04T14:17:04-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hi, yes, hello. Um, can you hear me okay? I'm on speaker, I've got my hands full of paper here."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-04T14:17:11-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I can hear you fine. Go ahead."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-04T14:17:14-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. So my mom just got a puppy, well, I'm calling for her, I'm her daughter, and she's at one fifty-eight Annandale Road, in the North End. And she needs a dog license, I think? I don't really know how it works."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-04T14:17:28-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, dogs in Newport need to be licensed. Is the puppy over six months old, do you know?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-04T14:17:34-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hang on, let me find it. [pause] Okay, it says here born in... August? So that's, what, almost six months. Is that over or under? I can't tell if that matters."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-04T14:17:44-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It can matter for the rabies shot, since puppies usually get it around that age. Has she had the rabies vaccine done?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-04T14:17:52-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, there's a certificate. The vet gave us this sheet, it says, um, rabies vaccination certificate, and then a tag number. But it's the copy. The vet kept the original, I think. Or maybe this is the original. It's pink. Is pink the original?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-04T14:18:06-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Doesn't matter much. A copy of the certificate is fine, as long as it's legible and shows the vaccine dates and the vet's information."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-04T14:18:14-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Oh, okay, good. So a copy is accepted. Because I was going to bring it and then I thought, wait, do they want the real one?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-04T14:18:23-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "A copy works. Keep the original at home."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-04T14:18:26-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. And what's the fee? Is it one fee or is it different if the dog is fixed? The vet paper says something about, hold on, spay, neuter, I don't see which one is checked."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-04T14:18:38-05:00",
      "duration": 15,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "There is a difference, usually, for spayed or neutered dogs. I don't have the exact amount in front of me, so I'll have you confirm it when you come in, or I can have someone call you back. Do you want to come to the counter?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-04T14:18:53-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Um, I guess I can come in. Wait, so I need the certificate and, is it the fixed paperwork too? Sorry, I'm reading and I lost my place."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-04T14:19:03-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Take your time. Bring the rabies certificate, and if the vet has a note on spay or neuter, bring that too. And your mom's name and address, and the dog's name, breed, and color."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-04T14:19:14-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, name, breed, color. She's, he's, sorry, he's a little brown mix. Is it okay if I do it for her, or does she have to be there?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-04T14:19:24-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You can bring it in for her. Just have all the information with you."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-04T14:19:29-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. And I'm kind of stuck at home, because I'm waiting on a package, winter boots, it says delivered by end of day. So maybe tomorrow I'll come. Is that all right?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-04T14:19:40-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Tomorrow's fine. We're open regular hours. If you want, give me a number in case I find the fee before you come."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-04T14:19:48-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sure. It's four-oh-one, five-five-five, zero-one-seven-two."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-04T14:19:51-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Got it, four-oh-one, five-five-five, zero-one-seven-two. I'll call if there's anything else."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-04T14:19:55-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. So just to make sure, the certificate copy is fine, and I bring the spay thing if there is one, and the fee I find out there. Right?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-04T14:20:05-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's right."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-04T14:20:07-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, I think I got it. Thank you. Sorry, I'm still kind of mixed up on the spay part, but I'll ask the vet."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-04T14:20:15-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's a good idea. Have a good afternoon."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-04T14:20:18-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You too. Bye."
    }
  ],
